OL,3,GNEWSAMurder suspect's mum accused of
OL,4,Awithholding information
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a man charged with
OL,7,Fmurdering Carrie Mullane told police
OL,8,Fthat she tried to intervene but "I
OL,9,Fcouldn't save the girl", a court has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FCarrie Mullane, 39, had been missing
OL,13,Fsince she arrived in Enniskillen,
OL,14,FCounty Fermanagh, from Limerick on 10
OL,15,FOctober 2026.
OL,17,FA body was recovered by police from
OL,18,FLough Erne on Monday and the formal
OL,19,Fidentification process is still
OL,20,Fongoing. A sunken boat was also
OL,21,Fdiscovered in the water.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
