OL,3,GNEWSAMurder suspect's mum accused of
OL,4,Awithholding information
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, 69-year-old Mary Lynch,
OL,7,Fof Trasna Park in Enniskillen, appeared
OL,8,Fat Dungannon Magistrates' Court charged
OL,9,Fwith withholding information from
OL,10,Fpolice.
